    "text": "<math> <mrow> <mn>245</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g</mtext></mrow> </math> impure sample of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> on heating gives <math> <mrow> <mn>12</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> </mfenced></mrow> </math> according to <math> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mrow> <mtext>KClO</mtext></mrow> <mtext>3</mtext> </msub> <mfenced> <mtext>s</mtext> </mfenced><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>KCl</mtext><mfenced> <mtext>s</mtext> </mfenced><mtext> </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>3</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />\rCalculate % purity of sample ?"
